# An autosave that cannot be written says so once a session, and leaves the document and what is on the disk alone.
@recovery
@full *.$$$
@file "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD" "dear sir"
cmd Open
choose "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD"
type ", and madam"
autosave
expect notice Status "Quill cannot autosave: the disk is full."
autosave
dump
